# 🧠 What Did We Learn?

| ✅ Good Practice                         | ❌ What Went Wrong                            |
| --------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |
| Don't put secrets in HTML attributes    | The flag was hidden in `notify_true`         |
| Don't rely on encoding for security     | Base64 can be easily decoded                 |
| Remove sensitive data before deployment | The encoded flag remained in the HTML        |
| Keep secrets server-side                | Sensitive information was sent to the client |

