## 🔐 Encoding vs Encryption

This is an important concept in web security.

### 📄 Encoding

```text
Plaintext
    ↓
Base64 Encode
    ↓
Encoded Data
```

Anyone can decode it.

### 🔒 Encryption

```text
Plaintext
    ↓
Encryption + Key
    ↓
Ciphertext
```

A proper encryption scheme requires the appropriate key to decrypt the data.

> **Base64 ≠ Encryption**

Base64 is simply a different representation of data.

